he two related skills (+10%) are a choose-2 group over the same seven categories - a judgement: the book says prerequisites of or related to the specialty, which is narrower than any category and not enforceable. W.P. Assault Rifle is stored as W.P. Automatic and Semi-automatic Rifles (the ngr-infantry-soldier precedent for an automatic-rifle W.P.). Hand to Hand: Basic to Expert for one other skill, Martial Arts or Assassin for two; no alignment condition is printed. || RELATED: the book prints R.C.C. Related Skills for a race played on its own, so they are granted: ten, plus two at level 3 and one at 6, 8, 11 and 14; every category Any with the printed bonuses (Communications +10, Domestic +5, Electrical +10, Espionage +5, Mechanical +10, Medical +5, Pilot +5, Pilot Related +5, Science +10, Technical +10). Secondary six, same list without bonuses. || EQUIPMENT: the book prints Weapons and Body Armor lines only. TB-Prime or FR-5 rifle as a choice; the energy weapon of choice as a choice of the Arkhon personal energy weapons (TB-3, TB-9, TB-Prime); Modified Arkhon Body Armor is the catalog arkhon-body-armor row, whose description already records the 110 M.D.C. modified version, with the 110 in the entry note. || MONEY: none printed; starting_money not stored. || Cybernetics: none, a restriction. || PAIRING: the Battlemaster O.C.C. (fallam-battlemaster) is open to this race only and is written as its addition."
